{"id":"chatcmpl-155574d8-dc4e-424a-ad84-8dd20b0cb970","object":"chat.completion","created":1795245744,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a verification-by-corroboration strategy for binary medical image findings: query a domain expert tool for the diagnostic claim, then independently query a grounded localization tool to confirm the anatomical side. The answer is only committed when both sources agree and explicitly exclude the alternative. The pattern generalizes to any forced-choice visual diagnosis where laterality, location, or subtype must be disambiguated.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When options differ only by a spatial attribute (side, location, subtype), first ask an expert tool to state the finding AND its spatial attribute explicitly, rather than just presence/absence.\",\n    \"Corroborate any single-tool diagnostic claim with a second independent tool (e.g., grounded localization) before committing, especially when the two options are near-mirror alternatives.\",\n    \"Require explicit exclusion of the competing option (not just positive evidence for the chosen one) as the decision criterion for forced-choice answers.\",\n    \"Decompose the question into a diagnostic sub-question (what finding?) and a localization sub-question (which side/site?) so each tool is used for its strength.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging forced-choice QA\": \"Use an expert diagnostic tool for the finding and a grounded/localization tool for the spatial attribute; commit only on agreement plus exclusion of the alternative.\",\n    \"Binary disambiguation tasks\": \"Convert the binary choice into an explicit attribute query (side, size, subtype) so the answer is directly evidenced rather than inferred.\",\n    \"Tool-corroboration workflows\": \"Pair a semantic/expert tool with a grounding tool; treat disagreement as a signal to re-query rather than guess.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the chosen option's key attribute (e.g., side) is explicitly stated by at least two independent sources.\",\n    \"Confirm the competing option is explicitly excluded or contradicted by the evidence before finalizing.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":440,"total_tokens":850,"completion_tokens":410,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":440},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":410}}}